<BaseLayout title="Fuses and electrical units">
  <h1>Fuses and electrical units</h1>
  <p>Volvo identifies three main central electrical-unit locations for the left-hand-drive 2021 S60: engine compartment, under the glove compartment, and cargo area. The vehicle's own fuse chart is the authority for individual fuse numbers and amperages.</p>

